# Ports and Adapters

## Invariant

Domain code depends on ports. Infrastructure implements adapters.

## Where things live

| Type | Location |
|------|----------|
| Port | `pulseboard_core/ports/` |
| Adapter | `pulseboard_connectors/` or `module_*/adapters/` |

## External systems

| System | Port | Adapter |
|--------|------|---------|
| LLM | `LlmPort` | Ollama connector |
| Postgres | repository ports on the owning module | SQLAlchemy adapter |
| Redis | cache or queue port when a module needs it | Redis connector |

New external system: port in core, adapter in connectors, use through the owning module.

## Do not

- Import the Ollama client from a service. Call `LlmPort`.
- Put ORM models in connectors. Models live in `pulseboard-models`.
